\sum_{j \in J} x_{ij} \leq cap_i \cdot y_i \quad \forall i \in I
\]

3. Non-negativity and integrality:
\[
x_{ij} \geq 0 \quad \forall i \in I, j \in J
\]
\[
y_i \in \{0,1\} \quad \forall i \in I
\]

Where:
- I = {A1, ..., A15}
- J = {B1, ..., B8}
- f_i, cap_i, d_j, c_{ij} as specified above.

